{"id":"en_the-luna-awakens-severing-our-five-year-mate-bond","title":"The Luna Awakens, Severing Our Five-Year Mate Bond","titleEn":"The Luna Awakens, Severing Our Five-Year Mate Bond","description":"Freya, blessed by the Moon Goddess as the fated mate and Luna of Alpha Damon, finds herself accused of secretly meeting a rogue wolf on the very night he wins a Council seat nomination, and she must submit to a mating mark test. Though he knows she is innocent, Damon still commands that the ritual fire be lit so that the pregnant Healer Chloe can take her place. Months of wolfsbane drugging, expulsion from her suite and false accusations drive Freya to despair, until she awakens the Silvermane silver wolf bloodline within her and brings the conspiracy to light.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-luna-awakens-severing-our-five-year-mate-bond/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-luna-awakens-severing-our-five-year-mate-bond/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Female Empowerment","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcgbi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-luna-awakens-severing-our-five-year-mate-bond_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcgbi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-luna-awakens-severing-our-five-year-mate-bond_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcgbi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-luna-awakens-severing-our-five-year-mate-bond_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embe